---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import Card from '../components/Card.astro';import {allProjects,href} from '../lib/archive';import {profile} from '../config';
const projects=await allProjects();const featured=projects.filter(p=>p.data.featured);const recent=projects.filter(p=>p.data.updated).sort((a,b)=>(b.data.updated||'').localeCompare(a.data.updated||'')).slice(0,3);
---
<Layout>
<section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> PERSONAL CREATIVE ARCHIVE</p><h1>创作的轨迹，<br/><em>未完待续。</em></h1><p class="hero-description">{profile.intro}</p><a class="button" href={href('archive/')}>走进档案馆 <span>↗</span></a></div><aside class="hero-note"><span class="big-star">✳</span><p>游戏 · 代码 · 数字艺术<br/>摄影 · 以及未来的可能</p><div class="note-line"></div><p class="muted">This is an evolving archive<br/>of my creative life.</p></aside></section>
<section><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">CURATED COLLECTION</p><h2>精选档案 <span>/ {String(featured.length).padStart(2,'0')}</span></h2></div><a href={href('archive/')}>全部作品 ↗</a></div><p class="section-note">以下为初始精选占位条目；真实素材、时间与创作记录将逐步补充。</p><div class="grid">{featured.map((p,i)=><Card project={p} index={i}/>)}</div></section>
<section class="recent"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">RECENT CHANGES</p><h2>最近更新</h2></div></div>{recent.length?<div class="grid">{recent.map((p,i)=><Card project={p} index={i}/>)}</div>:<div class="empty-panel"><span>01 / 等待第一份创作记录</span><p>尚未填写可核实的更新时间。补充作品后，这里会按更新日期自动展示。</p><a href={href('archive/')}>先浏览 {projects.length} 个档案条目 →</a></div>}</section>
</Layout>
